# Grade Calculator

A simple console program for teachers. The teacher enters a student's name and 5 scores, and the program shows the student's average and grade. It works for several students in one run.

## Requirements
- The program shall ask the teacher to enter a student's name or the word "end" to finish.
- The program shall accept exactly 5 scores for each student, each a whole number from 0 to 100.
- The program shall show an error message and ask again if a score is not a whole number from 0 to 100.
- The program shall calculate the average of the 5 scores and assign a grade.
- The program shall show the number of students entered and the class average after the teacher types "end".

## Grading scale
| Grade | Average |
|-------|---------|
| A | 90 - 100 |
| B | 75 - 89.99 |
| C | 60 - 74.99 |
| F | below 60 |

## How to run
1. Open https://www.onlinegdb.com and choose C++.
2. Paste the code from main.cpp and click Run.

